          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;The magicat blinks once before a devilish smirk emerges on her pretty features. She ducks her head until she is level with the bottom of Adora's breastplate, opening her round lips and placing the flat of her tongue on the center of the metal, dragging it up torturously slow. Her eyes flick upwards to meet the taller woman's cloudy blue ones as she comes closer to her face again, not drawing her tongue away until it's seconds from her bare throat. She feels like dying on the spot.&lt;br /&gt;--&lt;br /&gt;Adora has been Catra's guard for a year. She knows her- better than anyone, and would lay her life on the line to protect her, even though she doesn't need to. Catra has been acting differently than usual and seems to have become more apathetic.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;**COMPLETED&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
